# The research picker (PickTech), opened with the script host's "open tech_pick" step (the save plays blind research, which
# has no picker of its own; unk=1 asks for the list anyway). The tutorial note and the research priorities come first, and
# are answered. The picker is a grid of eight cards (four by two) over the whole screen. The state file's open_result region
# holds the tech the call answers. Leave time after each step; the snaps take 2 s each.
25 load
48 click 362 734        # the first-turn note's Close
50 open tech_pick
58 click 511 423        # the tutorial note's OK
62 click 511 444        # the research priorities' OK
68 snap open
70 move 390 220         # over the second card
74 snap hover
76 move 500 8           # outside the grid, over the title
80 snap hover-out
82 key Right
86 snap key-right
88 key Down
92 snap key-down
94 key Left
98 snap key-left
100 key Up
104 snap key-up
106 key Up
110 snap key-up-wrap
112 key Left
116 snap key-left-wrap
118 key c               # a letter: the first card whose name begins with it
122 snap key-letter
124 key Escape           # not used by the window
128 snap key-escape
130 key Return           # chooses the marked card
138 snap chosen-return
142 close
